  </data>
  <data name="AboutBody" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>ScreenStat
Select an area on screen, recognize it, count the numbers.
Everything runs locally; nothing is uploaded.
Hotkey: {0}</value>
    <comment>{0} is the current hotkey</comment>
  </data>

